content:
Hey threads,
Wanted to point out something very cool @cthompsonyyc does each week.

He highlights accounts he finds inspiring and enriching, and I was lucky enough to get a shoutout from him! 

Follow him, and also check out:

@morewithmj - in depth legal analysis
@valontinopierson83 - quick wit political takes
@bradley.thor - the opposite of toxic masculinity
@brenttoderian - common sense thoughtful and data backed policy/urbanism
@rutgerbregman - author of “moral ambition,”inspiring to all

